msgid "Hide the unread count beside Messages in the account menu"
msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:281
msgid "This is the separate count the Messages extension shows on its own account menu item. It is worth keeping: it says how many unread messages there are specifically, which the bell does not. Hide it only if you would rather people relied on the bell alone."
msgstr ""

